    "required": false,
    "disabled": false,
    "hidden": false,
    "numeric": true,
    "format": "decimal",
    "min": 1,
    "description": "Purchasing allowance, as a multiplier. 1.10 means order 10% more than the installed quantity. SEPARATE from the multiplier on purpose (ruling 2026-09-17): the multiplier states what goes in the ground and must stay a clean measurement; grossing up for waste is a purchasing step. Blank or 1.00 means no allowance."
   },
